mvspotlight (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Debian and Ubuntu.
  * Added AI Assistant with multi-LLM support (Gemini, OpenAI, Claude, Ollama).
  * Frameless Wayland-native window with GNOME 50 HIG styling.
  * Embedded Lua 5.4 plugin runtime and 8 bundled plugins.

